flowchart TD
    A[User sends a message with chat ID] --> B[Save message and load current facts]
    B --> C{Approved action still unresolved?}
    C -- Yes --> R[Ask user to retry the same confirmation]
    C -- No --> D[Build context from current facts and explicit preferences]
    D --> E{Input fits token budget?}
    E -- No --> F[Drop optional preferences or ask for shorter message]
    E -- Yes --> G[AI extracts new request details]
    G --> H[Validate and merge corrections]
    H --> I{Required details complete?}
    I -- No --> J[Ask for missing details]
    J --> A
    I -- Yes --> K{Action?}
    K -- Book --> L[Find providers within budget and time window]
    L --> M[Hold a slot and check final price]
    K -- Cancel or reschedule --> N[Check existing booking and ownership]
    M --> O[Save exact proposal and request approval]
    N --> O
    O --> P[User explicitly confirms proposal ID and fingerprint]
    P --> Q[Validate details and claim execution under row lock]
    Q --> S{Already completed?}
    S -- Yes --> T[Return saved result]
    S -- No --> U{Booking action?}
    U -- Yes --> V[Check provider status before booking]
    V --> W{Booking already exists?}
    W -- Yes --> X[Verify saved booking identity]
    W -- No --> Y[Book with the same durable retry key]
    Y --> Z[Check authoritative provider status]
    Z --> X
    U -- Cancel or reschedule --> AA[Execute approved change with retry key]
    X --> AB{Outcome verified?}
    AA --> AB
    AB -- Yes --> AC[Save result and show completion]
    AB -- Unknown --> R
    AB -- Known failure --> AD[Explain failure and request a fresh proposal]


flowchart LR
    A[Sync Django request] --> B[25-second cooperative agent budget]
    B --> C[AI HTTP call: connect up to 5 seconds and read up to 20 seconds]
    C --> D{Request stuck?}
    D -- No --> E[Return result or clear timeout reply]
    D -- Yes --> F[Gunicorn restarts the stuck sync worker around 30 seconds]
    F --> G[Browser keeps chat and shows retry guidance]
    G --> H[Retry same confirmation to reconcile uncertain booking]
